// Solid Eleven's toast (issue #95): a short message over any menu (a
// transfer, a save), lime when it went well, red when it didn't, amber for
// a warning (a save restored from its backup, issue #121), growing with the
// player's text scale.
//   cargo xtask ui export examples/solid-eleven/ui/toast.ui.ron examples/solid-eleven/src/ui/toast_gen.rs
(
    version: 1,
    name: "se_toast",
    scaling: Snap,
    theme: (
        font: "fonts/se_ui",
        text: Some((236, 240, 255, 255)),
        panel: Some((10, 12, 30, 235)),
    ),
    preview: {"good": Bool(true), "text": Text("JOGADOR CONTRATADO")},
    root: (
        children: [
            (
                kind: Rect(border: 1, border_color: Some((190, 255, 60, 255))),
                anchor: Bottom,
                offset: (0, -28),
                padding: (12, 2, 12, 2),
                visible_if: "good",
                children: [(kind: Text, bind: "text", text: "{}", color: Some((190, 255, 60, 255)))],
            ),
            (
                kind: Rect(border: 1, border_color: Some((230, 50, 70, 255))),
                anchor: Bottom,
                offset: (0, -28),
                padding: (12, 2, 12, 2),
                visible_if: "bad",
                children: [(kind: Text, bind: "text", text: "{}", color: Some((230, 50, 70, 255)))],
            ),
            (
                kind: Rect(border: 1, border_color: Some((255, 190, 40, 255))),
                anchor: Bottom,
                offset: (0, -28),
                padding: (12, 2, 12, 2),
                visible_if: "warn",
                children: [(kind: Text, bind: "text", text: "{}", color: Some((255, 190, 40, 255)))],
            ),
        ],
    ),
)
